\title{Domain Specific Architectures}
\date{2026-07-05T12:22:59Z}

\p{Five principles to guide DSA design.}
\ol{
  \li{\em{Use dedicated memories to minimize distance data travels.} [Caches](M91V).}
  \li{\em{Invest resources saved into more arithmetic units or bigger memories}.}
  \li{\em{Use easiest parallelism that matches domain.}}
  \li{\em{Reduce data size and type to simplest needed for domain.}}
  \li{\em{Use domain-specific programming language to port code.}}
}
